    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>父亲 = le père / papa</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>母亲 = la mère / maman</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>父母 = les parents</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>爷爷/奶奶 = les grands-parents</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>单亲家庭 = une famille </span><strong><span>mono</span></strong><span>parentale</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>继父/继母 = le beau-père / la belle-mère</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>儿子 = le fils</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>女儿 = la fille</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>哥哥 = le frère </span><strong><span>aîné</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>弟弟 = le frère </span><strong><span>cadet</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>姐姐 = la sœur </span><strong><span>aînée</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>妹妹 = la sœur </span><strong><span>cadette</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>丈夫 = le mari</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>妻子 = la femme</span><strong><span>（女人也是这个词汇哦）</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>姑姑/阿姨 = la tante</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>叔叔/舅舅 /大爷（南方人平时使用大爷这个词吗？）= l'oncle</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>表兄弟/表姐妹 = le cousin / la cousine</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>外甥/外甥女 = le neveu / la nièce</span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
